{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1396637884"}, "name":{"label":"FloWi03TUM"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-25T09:26:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"9546328078"}, "title":{"label":"Tut was es soll, oft Buggy"}, "content":{"label":"Eigentlich bin ich wirklich zu Frieden mit der App und ich nutze sie gerne. Leider stoppt manchmal die Musik aus unerklärlichen Gründen und oder die App hängt sich auf, sodass sie neu gestartet werden muss. Schade ist auch, dass man sie zwar auf einem (Apple Silicon) Mac installieren kann, sie da aber nie über den Ladebildschrim hinauskommt. Das Selbe hatte ich auch oft auf iPad oder iOS.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id106829407"}, "name":{"label":"flauschibärchen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-02-07T23:18:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"8331841422"}, "title":{"label":"This is a nice experiment but not (yet) comparable to human music"}, "content":{"label":"This is a nice experiment but not (yet) comparable to human music. If this was a university project (maybe a Master’s project) would sound reasonable - but actually charging more than 30€ per year is totally out of bounds. The music doesn’t sound complete and smooth or interesting at all, compared to music made by humans. The human feeling and emotions are missing that make music great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id189781039"}, "name":{"label":"Medialogix"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-12-04T04:30:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"8093839339"}, "title":{"label":"no more \"share\"?! ..."}, "content":{"label":"Bis letztens hatte ich nichts zu meckern. Diese App hat meine Erwartungen erfüllt. Seit dem letzten Update, jedoch, funktioniert das Speichern der kurzen 60s Clips nicht mehr. (iPad M1; iOs 14.7.1). Da diese Funktion für mich kauf (abo) entscheidend war, kann ich zur Zeit nur einen Stern vergeben.\nUpdate:\ni don't know what bug (about sharing) has been fixed in v.4.2.1 - i still can't share anything. (iPadOS 15.1 now). Sounds are still great ... btw.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
